<title>HONG KONG: Korea First seen planning $100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea First seen planning $100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea First Bank is asking banks to bid for a mandate to arrange a US$100 million floating rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of three to five years.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
